        <ns0:ActivityCategory_Rationale_ChemClass_ERB rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Mycoestrogens are most active phytoestrogens; for same framework with 7-OH, RBAs are 100-fold higher for a isomers (do-o approx 11A) , as in E2 and DES, than for b isomers (do-o approx 10A).</ns0:ActivityCategory_Rationale_ChemClass_ERB>
